#: ../../variables/variables_classical.rst:6
msgid ":index:`Classical Music Tags <tags; classical>`"
msgstr ":index:`古典音乐标签 <tags; classical>`"

#: ../../variables/variables_classical.rst:8
msgid "With the help of plugins like \"Classical Extras\" or \"Work & Movement\" you can make use of the following tags for tagging your classical music."
msgstr ""
"在 \"Classical Extras\" 或 \"Work & Movement\" 等插件的帮助下，你可以使用以下"
"标签为你的古典音乐进行标记。"

#: ../../variables/variables_classical.rst:10
msgid "**movement**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../variables/variables_classical.rst:12
msgid "Name of the movement (e.g.: \"Andante con moto\")."
msgstr "乐章名称（例如：\"Andante con moto\"）。"

#: ../../variables/variables_classical.rst:14
msgid "**movementnumber**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../variables/variables_classical.rst:16
msgid "Movement number in Arabic numerals (e.g.: \"2\"). Players explicitly supporting this tag will often display it in Roman numerals (e.g.: \"II\")."
msgstr ""
"阿拉伯数字表示的乐章编号（例如：\"2\"）。明确支持此标签的播放器通常会以罗马数"
"字显示（例如：\"II\"）。"

#: ../../variables/variables_classical.rst:18
msgid "**movementtotal**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../variables/variables_classical.rst:20
msgid "Total number of movements in the work (e.g.: \"4\")."
msgstr "作品中的乐章总数（例如：\"4\"）。"

#: ../../variables/variables_classical.rst:22
msgid "**showmovement**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../variables/variables_classical.rst:24
msgid "Show Work & Movement: If this tag is set to \"1\" players supporting this tag, such as iTunes and MusicBee, will display the work, movement number and movement name instead of the track title. For example, the track will be displayed as \"Symphony no. 5 in C minor, op. 67: II. Andante con moto\" regardless of the value of the title tag."
msgstr ""
"显示 Work & Movement：如果此标签设置为 \"1\"，支持此标签的播放器（如 iTunes "
"和 MusicBee）将显示作品、乐章编号和乐章名称，而不是音轨标题。例如，无论标题标"
"签的值如何，音轨将显示为 \"Symphony no. 5 in C minor, op. 67: II. Andante "
"con moto\"。"

#: ../../variables/variables_classical.rst:26
msgid "**work**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../variables/variables_classical.rst:28
msgid "Work Name of the overall work (e.g.: \"Symphony no. 5 in C minor, op. 67\")."
msgstr "整体作品的名称（例如：\"Symphony no. 5 in C minor, op. 67\"）。"

#: ../../variables/variables_classical.rst:32
msgid "If you are using iTunes together with MP3 files you should activate the \"Save iTunes compatible grouping and work\" option in order for the work to be displayed correctly."
msgstr ""
"如果你使用 iTunes 与 MP3 文件一起，你应该激活 \"保存 iTunes 兼容分组和工作\" "
"选项，以便正确显示工作。"
